# Override the stock ColorOS face-unlock HIDL service (face_hal).
#
# The stock service registers vendor.oppo.hardware.biometrics.face@1.0, which
# the AOSP/LineageOS 10 framework does not bind to. The OPPO face stack's
# framework side (android.frameworks.faceservice@1.0::IFaceHalService, hosted
# by the ColorOS system_server fork and consumed by ColorOS SystemUI/Settings)
# is not in this ROM, and the two system-side interface libraries the service
# DT_NEEDEDs (android.frameworks.faceservice@1.0.so and
# vendor.oppo.hardware.biometrics.face@1.0.so) are deliberately not imported,
# so the loader cannot start it at all in this build -- it would only spawn a
# dead process at late_start forever. Disable it like fps_hal/fpay_hal. The
# AOSP biometric stack stays wired to fingerprint only.
service face_hal /vendor/bin/hw/vendor.oppo.hardware.biometrics.face@1.0-service
    override
    class late_start
    user system
    group system input
    disabled
    oneshot
